        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 20, Green Glass Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBy itself, this exquisite green glass knob is indeed beautiful; but when paired with one of Fusion Hardware's glamorous rosettes, the knob is even more gorgeous. Available in a wide array of finishes, this Scalloped Green Knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 20 Green Scalloped Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Designer Green Glass Door Knob Fusion 20:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Scalloped Green Glass Knob, Fusion 20",
                "description": "Green Scalloped Glass Fusion 20 - By itself, this exquisite green glass knob is indeed beautiful; but when paired with one of Fusion Hardware's glamorous rosettes, the knob is even more gorgeous. Available in a wide array of finishes, this Scalloped Green Knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
